        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\ntitle: Dine-in Order and Payment\n---\nsequenceDiagram\n  actor Customer\n  participant App as Mobile App\n  participant QR as QR Service\n  participant API as Order API\n  participant DB as Database\n  participant Kitchen\n  actor Chef\n  participant Pay as Payment Gateway\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Scan table QR code\n  App-&gt;&gt;QR: validateQR(code)\n  QR-&gt;&gt;DB: Verify table and restaurant\n  DB--&gt;&gt;QR: Table details\n  QR--&gt;&gt;App: Display restaurant menu\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Select food items\n  App-&gt;&gt;API: createOrder(items, tableNumber)\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save order and order items\n  DB--&gt;&gt;API: Order created\n  API-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Send new order\n  Kitchen--&gt;&gt;Chef: Display kitchen order\n  Chef-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Accept order\n  Kitchen-&gt;&gt;API: Update order status\n  API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save status\n  Chef-&gt;&gt;Kitchen: Mark order ready\n  Kitchen-&gt;&gt;API: Update status to READY\n  API--&gt;&gt;App: Notify customer\n\n  Customer-&gt;&gt;App: Make payment\n  App-&gt;&gt;Pay: processPayment(amount)\n  Pay--&gt;&gt;App: Payment result\n\n  alt Payment successful\n    App-&gt;&gt;API: Confirm payment\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Update payment status\n    API--&gt;&gt;App: Payment successful\n  else Payment failed\n    Pay--&gt;&gt;App: Payment failed\n    App--&gt;&gt;Customer: Retry payment\n  end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="2">
